# Line endings: the repository stores LF, and every checkout gets CRLF, whatever the
# machine's core.autocrlf setting. This is a Windows-only project, so files look the
# same in Visual Studio and Notepad no matter where they were edited or committed.
# cmd.exe needs CRLF in .cmd files to find labels reliably.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Never touch these
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
